  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Comprehensive Child Care Program (PAININ, Phase IV)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Atencion Integral a la Niez (PAININ Etapa IV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objeivo del programa es apoyar el desarrollo sico social, cognitivo y fisico de los ninios de las comunidades ms marginadas para asegurar su ingreso oportuno al primer grado.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the Program is to support the psychosocial, cognitive and physical development of low-income children under six years of age to ensure their timely entry the formal education system.</narrative>
  </description>
